  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02946-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">「第１ 企業の概況　５ 従業員の状況」</jpcrp030000-asr_E02946-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyHumanCapitalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02946-000:RiskManagementHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 32px; text-align: left"&gt;③リスク管理&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 56px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;
